    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 1.2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="1.2" corresp="#wit-b">Þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> is ðon<hi rend="italic">ne</hi>, þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> nan man oðru<hi rend="italic">m</hi> rihtes ne wyrne.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="1.2" corresp="#wit-h">Ðæt is ðonne, ðæt nan man oðrum ryhtes ne wyrne.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="1.2" corresp="#wit-q">Hoc est tunc, ne quisquam rectum disfortiet alicui.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#attenborough" n="§2" corresp="#wit-h">Ðæt is ðonne, ðæt nan man oðrum ryhtes ne wyrne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">Now his concern is that no man shall withhold from another his rights.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Nämlich dann, dass niemand einem Anderen Rechtsgang weigere.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Namely then, that no one refuse another [his] legal process.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="143"><ref target="clause:IEw_2">I Ew 2</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">Vgl. I Ew. 2</note>
        <note type="comparison" source="#wormald-ppmel" n="195"><label>cf.</label> <ref target="clause:IEw_2-1">I Ew 2.1</ref> <quote>2 f. II Edward 1:23: That no one obstruct another's ryhtes ... [cf. I Edward 2:1]</quote></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-ppmel" n="196"><ref target="clause:Ine_8">Ine 8</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="316"><ref target="clause:IIIEg_1-1">III Eg 1.1–4</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="316"><ref target="clause:IIIEg_5">III Eg 5–5.2</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="383"><ref target="clause:Iudex_Iudex-1">Iudex</ref></note>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares I Ew 2.</note>
      </div>
